If its something really unique and special use a separate annotation class like we ve done for InterfaceSpecAnnotation.

But if we are annotating constants or runtime parameters around injected constructor fields use @Named("Classname.fieldname") and 
at the point of bind use 
   bind(SomeInterfaceClass.class).annotatedWith(Names.named("Classname.fieldname")).to(SomeImplementationClass.name)